  <item>
    <title>E08.李连杰X田惠萍X薛晓路：《海洋天堂》十五年，一场未完成的托付</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/68c44128a56ca3e0c41ec523</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">68c44128a56ca3e0c41ec523</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 13 Sep 2025 04:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FppeM9VAYYJG-vxuM10P1C-5aQGK.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>电影《海洋天堂》上映十五周年之际，我们邀请李连杰先生与导演薛晓路重回故事起点，探访原型家庭——田惠萍与她的孤独症儿子弢弢。当年影片中“父亲离去，大福如何生存”的追问，至今仍是中国百万孤独症家庭的现实困境。</span></p><span></span><p><span>“我走了以后，他怎么办？”田惠萍的忧虑背后，是整个大龄孤独症群体面临的“托孤”难题。她为弢弢设立信托、组建监护团队，甚至邀请薛晓路担任“名誉主席”，却在资金、服务与法律的细节中步履维艰。她说：“我们不能等到不得已才行动。”</span></p><span></span><p><span>值此十五周年，字节跳动公益和壹基金“海洋天堂计划”携手，汇聚平台与公众力量，共同关注孤独症生命全程支持议题。每一个孤独症孩子终将长大，每一个父母终将老去。他们的未来，需要更多被看见、被支撑。</span></p><span></span><p><span>“愿我们的同胞，在生命的全阶段都留有关于他们的记忆。”</span></p><span></span><p><span>田惠萍：《海洋天堂》父亲角色王新诚的“原型”</span></p><span></span><p><span>李连杰：壹基金志愿者</span></p><span></span><p><span>薛晓路：《海洋天堂》电影编剧 导演</span></p><span></span><p><span>附：</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.douyin.com/video/7549092665078467849" data-url="https://www.douyin.com/video/7549092665078467849"><span>李连杰先生公益探访深度片：海洋天堂15年了，再次重访田老师和弢弢，发生了很多变化。我一直坚信人人公益，尽我所能，世界一定会改变</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.douyin.com/video/7549142559092788490" data-url="https://www.douyin.com/video/7549142559092788490"><span>视频播客上集：《海洋天堂》15年后@李连杰 再访田惠萍老师，聆听她如何带着孤独症儿子背包走世界，用一生写一个关于爱与坚持的故事</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.douyin.com/video/7549140629909982464" data-url="https://www.douyin.com/video/7549140629909982464"><span>视频播客下集：父母日渐老去，孤独症孩子未来何去何从？大龄孤独症家庭托孤，需要更广泛的社会力量支持</span><br><span> </span><br><span>&nbsp;</span></a></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqSfI0rkL5FN6qiGvg1wsOfsEbk4.jpg"></figure>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/6772325d05a12f43137bbb58/llmtKJHFjqv1fJnrFXOsjNfLixLV.m4a" length="116908845" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:00:32</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgOhu_y7I3hCe0BSBNVNWN0qQJvt.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>E07.张易：从记录到行动，我用流量做好事</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/689469a1638b0158796da75a</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">689469a1638b0158796da75a</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 07 Aug 2025 08:57:14 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>在这个追逐流量的时代，人们对流量的反思和批评也越来越多。 流量可以让一个人在一夜之间身价倍增，所以我们见证了无数为流量而搏出位的现象，这也是让大家对此反感的原因。</span></p><span></span><p><span>可是，如果这些流量被用在了</span><strong><span>传递善意</span></strong><span>上呢？</span></p><span></span><p><span>今天故事的讲述者张易，是一个百万粉丝的短视频博主。</span></p><span></span><p><span>一个偶然的机会，张易把镜头对准了身边温暖人心的小人物，小故事。结果，这给他带来了</span><strong><span>泼天的流量。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>于是张易，想用这些流量，来做点事情。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>讲述者 | 字节跳动公益合作创作者 张易</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播 | @故事FM 爱哲</span></p><span></span><p><span>制作 | 陈思宇</span></p><span></span><p><span>文案整理 | 陈思宇</span></p><span></span><p><span>声音设计 |陈思宇</span></p><span></span><p><span>运营 | 鸣鸣</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/6772325d05a12f43137bbb58/lqwUvDyb1C0_v_XCS_GjP-7yMNYB.m4a" length="58092955" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:40:03</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpQgUl9cbA_1oTXn1pJmVIunU6bP.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>E06.唇腭裂会在中国“消失”吗？今天聊了聊关于“缺陷”和不完美的事</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/683be36b31215eb506c0be54</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">683be36b31215eb506c0be54</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 01 Jun 2025 05:23:54 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FntNtMFkpbxsRte0VudEtwdeXv7j.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>各位听众，一件好事第二季回来啦。本期内容我们请来了尹恒医生和六层楼来跟我们一起聊聊唇腭裂这件事。</span></p><span></span><p><span>唇腭裂是一种先天疾病，在我国的出生缺陷中位列前三，每年大约有1.5-3w的唇腭裂新生患儿。有很多父母会因为对于这个疾病的认知不足，在产检中发现了胎儿唇腭裂的状况，就放弃掉这个胎儿。我们希望通过本期节目，把更多信息传递给遇到唇腭裂疾病的父母，希望他们在做出选择前能有更多的视角和信息去判断。</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果你的家庭需要帮助或者认识需要帮助的人，请把关键信息告诉他们，抖音搜索“唇腭裂救助”，我们会为面对唇腭裂疾病无力诊治的家庭提供响应和帮助。</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期嘉宾】</span></p><span></span><p><span>尹恒，四川大学华西口腔医院言语治疗师</span></p><span></span><p><span>六层楼，科普创作者，万千女性的妇产科老棉裤</span></p><span></span><p><span>【主播】</span></p><span></span><p><span>@托泥_</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>本期导览</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="886">00:14:46</a> 什么是唇腭裂？唇腭裂的成因有被发现么？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1212">00:20:12</a> 目前能达到的治疗效果？手术后是不是完全看不出来？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1680">00:28:00</a> 抖音唇腭裂关爱行动，助力困难唇腭裂患儿应治尽治，夸夸！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2639">00:43:59</a> 唇腭裂小朋友在成长过程中会遭遇什么？在学校会不会被霸凌？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3915">01:05:15</a> 目前有什么新的诊治手段？AI产品如何辅助口音治疗？</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>音乐</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>Bounce - Steven Gutheinz -musicbed</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>制作</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>吕东</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>剪辑</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>赫楠</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/6772325d05a12f43137bbb58/lsqQWz-39dkVrXJaHgtF-cTjhNCC.m4a" length="115525553" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:19:36</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrLNFWFkU9rH8wzsGB6Nhtf7dX-k.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>E05.小鹿：我到乡村小学给女孩捐卫生巾，见到自由成长的孩子</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67cc072ae924d4525a25a9b7</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67cc072ae924d4525a25a9b7</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 08 Mar 2025 09:40:01 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtiJ4yRbN8RF8tbXi8W3JAQ9wlwE.jpeg"></figure><span></span><p><span>本期节目的嘉宾是大家非常熟悉的脱口秀演员小鹿。2024年12月，小鹿在「我的中女时代」脱口秀巡演天津演出现场宣布将个人脱口秀巡演（天津专场）部分票务收入捐赠爱小丫「女生加油计划」。上周，小鹿前往宣威市靖外明德小学探访女孩们的变化，作为云南宣威籍艺人，她以“小丫姐姐”和捐赠人双重身份出席，为五年级女生发放“小丫包”（含内衣、卫生巾等物资）。今天，小鹿和我们聊一聊她这次的走访见闻，以及自己参与公益的旅程。</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期嘉宾】小鹿，脱口秀演员。</span></p><span></span><p><span>【主播】@爱哲、@托泥_</span></p><span></span><p><span>【内容大纲】</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/upload?userType=3&amp;voicelistId=1218982501#" data-url="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/upload?userType=3&amp;voicelistId=1218982501#"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="153">00:02:33</a></span></a><span> 走访云南「神奇小学」，孔雀、鸵鸟、菜地、全省第一女足队和养猪校长</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/upload?userType=3&amp;voicelistId=1218982501#" data-url="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/upload?userType=3&amp;voicelistId=1218982501#"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="434">00:07:14</a></span></a><span> 一个对教育有想法的校长，和自由成长的孩子们</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/upload?userType=3&amp;voicelistId=1218982501#" data-url="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/upload?userType=3&amp;voicelistId=1218982501#"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="735">00:012:15</a></span></a><span> 学校如何重塑留守儿童自信</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/upload?userType=3&amp;voicelistId=1218982501#" data-url="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/upload?userType=3&amp;voicelistId=1218982501#"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1143">00:19:03</a></span></a><span> 小鹿的初心：其实小时候就是很辛苦啊，我想做些什么，让更多孩子看到自己的可能性</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/upload?userType=3&amp;voicelistId=1218982501#" data-url="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/upload?userType=3&amp;voicelistId=1218982501#"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1285">00:21:25</a></span></a><span> 小女孩暴击："你一直讲笑话是职业病吗？"</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/upload?userType=3&amp;voicelistId=1218982501#" data-url="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/upload?userType=3&amp;voicelistId=1218982501#"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1497">00:24:57</a></span></a><span> 段子打破月经羞耻，有观众带妈妈看演出后，妈妈主动就医取节育环</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/upload?userType=3&amp;voicelistId=1218982501#" data-url="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/upload?userType=3&amp;voicelistId=1218982501#"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2009">00:33:29</a></span></a><span> 性教育公开课，对孩子们来说，科普是件很重要的事。</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/upload?userType=3&amp;voicelistId=1218982501#" data-url="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/upload?userType=3&amp;voicelistId=1218982501#"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2185">00:36:25</a></span></a><span> 爆笑合照，孩子们全程追着托马斯练英语却只说一句 Where are you from？</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/upload?userType=3&amp;voicelistId=1218982501#" data-url="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/upload?userType=3&amp;voicelistId=1218982501#"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2363">00:39:23</a></span></a><span> 小鹿的暖心故事分享：从陪看病到买电脑的"非典型"助学</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/upload?userType=3&amp;voicelistId=1218982501#" data-url="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/upload?userType=3&amp;voicelistId=1218982501#"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2827">00:47:07</a></span></a><span> 奶奶的公益启蒙：端着肉碗走遍全村的童年记忆</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/upload?userType=3&amp;voicelistId=1218982501#" data-url="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/upload?userType=3&amp;voicelistId=1218982501#"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3597">00:59:57</a></span></a><span> 《一件好事》主播海岳身份大揭秘</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/upload?userType=3&amp;voicelistId=1218982501#" data-url="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/upload?userType=3&amp;voicelistId=1218982501#"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3937">01:05:37</a></span></a><span> 公益短剧脑洞现场：给你五千万，离开我女儿</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/upload?userType=3&amp;voicelistId=1218982501#" data-url="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/upload?userType=3&amp;voicelistId=1218982501#"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4088">01:08:08</a></span></a><span> 小鹿未来计划与公益新想象，《中女时代》收官场「见好就收」</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/upload?userType=3&amp;voicelistId=1218982501#" data-url="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/upload?userType=3&amp;voicelistId=1218982501#"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4293">01:11:33</a></span></a><span> 即将开启人生新副本： 备孕妈妈的脱口秀野望</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fr3IUoziHT8csG71DxfrysPz7rdx.jpeg"></figure>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/6772325d05a12f43137bbb58/lghF5HJsNlYguPGar0POoybTw-hE.m4a" length="107159508" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:13:53</itunes:duration>
